      "text": "4月份到现在都没有人买过"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 48790,
      "end_ms": 50570,
      "text": "那这个这个确实是你垫啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 50570,
      "end_ms": 51840,
      "text": "这个确实是你店吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 51840,
      "end_ms": 54500,
      "text": "江山是四川的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 54500,
      "end_ms": 58020,
      "text": "换一换啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 58020,
      "end_ms": 58640,
      "text": "好的好的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 58640,
